mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼官宣加入OpenAI投身AI安全研究</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由姚顺雨统管基础模型部</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Alphabet第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，Google Cloud运营利润率升至35.6%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">黑森林实验室发布FLUX3多模态模型，支持20秒音视频生成与机器人行为预测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dbf511116b0653d1158ca75dacce62e6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Black Forest Labs正式推出FLUX3多模态基础模型，该模型采用统一架构联合学习图像、视频和音频，并基于Self-Flow自监督流匹配框架进行扩展。FLUX3支持单次生成最长20秒的视频及原生音频，具备文生视频、图生视频、视频生视频、关键帧转视频及多镜头串联等多种创作模式。在人工评测中，FLUX3在10秒720p视频生成任务中表现优异，对比Grok Imagine Video胜率达69%，对比Seedance 2.0和Gemini Omni Flash胜率均为52%。除内容生成外，FLUX3还具备图像生成与编辑能力，并正与Mimic Robotics合作探索机器人行为预测应用，旨在将多模态AI能力从数字创作延伸至实体机器人领域。目前，FLUX3已以Early Access方式上线，标志着其从单一生</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源0.8B参数文档解析模型OvisOCR2，登顶OmniDocBench基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cb30ff938973a12cf696bd77d1ded8b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴正式开源0.8B参数规模的文档解析模型OvisOCR2，该模型在OmniDocBench v1.6基准测试中以96.58分登顶，成为首个超越传统流水线方法的端到端文档解析模型。OvisOCR2基于Qwen3.5-0.8B后训练，通过单模型一次生成即可输出包含文本、公式、表格及视觉区域的Markdown格式，解决了传统“版面分析+内容识别”流水线模式中误差累积与部署复杂的问题。技术上，该模型结合真实与合成数据，利用SFT、RL、OPD及模型融合技术提升性能。目前，OvisOCR2已在Hugging Face及魔搭社区以Apache 2.0协议开源，兼容vLLM推理框架。其小参数、高精度的特性显著降低了企业知识库与RAG应用中的算力门槛，推动文档智能向高效模型驱动范式演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼官宣加入OpenAI投身AI安全研究</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/730c66fd8008a8495148a3d15a35b002.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年国际数学家大会新科菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼（Jacob Zimmerman）正式宣布加入OpenAI，将专注于AI安全领域的研究。齐默尔曼是加拿大籍数学家，凭借将o-极小性理论重塑为算术几何与复代数几何基础工具，成功证明了格里菲斯周期图像代数性猜想及安德烈-奥尔特猜想，在数论领域贡献卓著。OpenAI首席研究官马克·陈（Mark Chen）及研究员布贝克（Bubeck）已确认该消息，并高度评价其数学天赋及对AI安全议题的审慎态度。齐默尔曼曾于2003年、2004年两度摘得IMO金牌，师从数论名家彼得·萨纳克，此前任教于多伦多大学。此次顶尖数学家跨界投身AI安全，标志着AI治理领域对高精尖学术人才的吸引力显著增强，行业对AI系统安全性与鲁棒性的底层逻辑研究或将迎来新的理论突破。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由姚顺雨统管基础模型部</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f427fa5c2d92a15cc77ab1b6b6a1c035.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯于7月23日正式宣布组织架构调整，将原有的混元多模态模型部门与大语言模型部门合并，组建全新的基础模型部。该部门由腾讯首席AI科学家姚顺雨统一管理。此次重组旨在打破多模态与语言模型之间的研发壁垒，提升模型研发与协同效率，通过统一的指挥中枢加速全模态模型的迭代与智能上限探索。姚顺雨此前已于去年12月兼任大语言模型部负责人，此次调整进一步将“能看图”与“能对话”的技术路线深度整合。这一举措标志着腾讯在混元模型的技术研发上进入了全模态统一架构的新阶段，通过资源与技术栈的深度融合，强化其在基础模型领域的竞争力，对后续混元系列模型的多模态交互能力与逻辑推理表现将产生直接影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Alphabet第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，Google Cloud运营利润率升至35.6%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94144b689fb240822bd21f2db8ddc42c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Alphabet发布2026年第二季度财报，资本支出同比暴涨100%至创纪录的449.2亿美元，主要投向AI基础设施建设。得益于AI需求强劲，Google Cloud营收同比增长82%达248亿美元，运营利润率从此前水平大幅提升至35.6%，积压订单规模达5140亿美元。在模型应用方面，Gemini月活用户已达9.5亿，模型API每分钟处理token量达220亿。谷歌通过高额资本投入构建AI基建，并依托云业务的高增长与利润率改善，验证了AI基础设施周期的商业闭环。行业分析指出，超大规模云服务商的资本支出将持续攀升，预计2027年全球相关支出将突破1.2万亿美元，数据中心建设将成为核心投入领域。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
